  "img": "modules/dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw/Nicons/img/races/GGR/Centaur.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<div><table class=\"w-100 summary stripe-even\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">屬性值提升</strong></span></p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">體型</strong></span></p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">速度</strong></span></p></th></tr><tr><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>力量 +2; 感知 +1</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\">中等體型</span></p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\">40尺</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Age\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">年齡:</strong>人馬的成熟與衰老速度和人類相同。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\" /><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">陣營:</strong>人馬傾向於中立。那些加入瑟雷尼亞的人馬通常是中立善良的，而加入古魯部族的通常是混亂中立。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\" /><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">體型:</strong>人馬站立有6到7尺高，馬身肩高4尺左右，你是中等體型<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\" /><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">速度:</strong>你的基礎步行速度爲40尺。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\" /><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">妖精：</strong>你的生物類型是精類，而非類人。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\" /><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">衝鋒：</strong>如果你在一個回合中向着某個目標直線移動了至少30尺之後，以近戰武器攻擊命中了目標，你可以立刻在此次攻擊後以附贈動作，使用你的馬蹄攻擊該目標。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\" /><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">馬蹄：</strong>你的馬蹄視作天生近戰武器，你可以用來做徒手攻擊。如果你以蹄擊中目標，將造成1d4+力量調整值的鈍擊傷害，替代你通常的徒手攻擊傷害。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\" /><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">馬體構造：</strong>在決定你的載重與推拉抬極限時，視你爲大一級的體型。另外，因爲你的馬腿，任何需要手腳並用的攀爬對你而言尤其困難。當你進行這樣的攀爬時，每移動1尺需要花費額外4尺移動力，而非額外1尺。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\" /><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">生存專家：</strong>你從以下技能中選擇一種獲得其熟練項：馴獸，醫藥，自然或生存。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\" /><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">語言：</strong>你可以說、讀與寫通用語和木族語。木族語因爲其具有豐富的詞彙來描述自然現象和精神力量而廣泛運用於瑟雷尼亞盟會。</span></p></div></div><hr class=\"hr-1\" /><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--1\"><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif\"><strong style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\">天生的騎兵</strong><br style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\" />拉尼卡這個龐大的城市，與“開闊的道路”完全是矛盾的，而“開闊的平原”則純粹是胡說八道，但人馬仍然熱愛廣闊的空間和旅行的自由。人馬總是儘可能的在寬闊的廣場、寬敞的公園、廢墟和廢墟中奔跑。它們迎風疾馳，蹄聲雷鳴，尾巴在後面流淌，直到下一道牆在他們的道路上隱約出現，才能讓他們停下蹄子。<br style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\" />人馬擁有肌肉發達的人類的上身，下至腰部，顯示出人類各種膚色和特徵。他們的耳朵有點尖，但是他們的臉比精靈的更瘦，更整齊。在腰部以下，他們有着小馬的身體，顏色範圍相似，從栗子或赤褐色的各種色調到斑點或斑馬狀的條紋圖案。大多數人馬的頭髮和尾巴風格都是相似的。瑟雷尼亞的人馬喜歡長而流動的頭髮。古魯部族的人馬則把頭髮剪成粗糙、尖刺的風格。<br style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\" />人馬的上半身在尺寸上可與人體軀幹相媲美，下半身的馬身在肩高處平均有4英尺高。雖然它們比騎在馬上的人體要小，但他們正充當着類似的角色——騎兵、信使、先鋒與斥候。<br style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\" /><strong style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\">天性與族羣</strong><br style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\" />人馬與自然世界有一種親和力。在那些擁有這種親密關係的行會中，人馬偏愛格魯部族的碎礫區，瑟雷尼亞盟會在葛加理城郊隧道之上的寬闊廣場和析米克聯合的實驗室。人們慶祝生命和成長，小馬駒的出生往往意味着節日。<br style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\" />與此同時，人馬亦敬畏着過去的傳統，在古魯部族和瑟雷尼亞盟會之中，他們是記憶和歷史的代言人，保存古老的儀式，並且使關於英雄祖先的傳說保持生機。他們與野生動物之間有着一些親密的聯繫，興許是因爲他們的混血本性使然，他們在與成羣結隊的野獸們一起奔跑的感覺中收穫快樂。<br style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\" /><strong style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\">宗族與族羣</strong><br style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\" />人馬能感受到自然世界的相互聯繫。因此，他們將家庭和族羣視作更大聯繫的縮影。在格魯部落中，他們有着很強的族羣認同感；瑟雷尼亞人馬對個人族羣和整個公會都非常忠誠。他們對歷史和傳統的熱愛也意味着人馬比大多數其他拉尼卡人更有可能加入他們父母所在的行會。<br style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\" /><strong style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\">人馬的姓名</strong><br style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\" />人馬的名字隨着家族延續而傳承。新生的馬駒往往以最近去世的同性家族成員的名字爲名，從而讓逝者的記憶留存下來——人馬相信名字是靈魂的碎片。<br style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\" />人馬很少使用姓，而是穿着代表家庭成員的標誌。這些標誌通常包括植物或動物的圖案，印好的格言，編織成辯或串珠的頭髮或尾巴，或僅僅是特殊的織物圖案。<br style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\" /><strong style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\">男用名：</strong> Bonmod, Boruvo, Chodi, Drozan, Kozim, Milosh, Ninos, Oleksi, Orval, Radovas, Radom, Rostis, Svetyos, Tomis, Trijiro, Volim, Vlodim,Yarog<br style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\" /><strong style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\">女用名: </strong>Daiva, Dunja, Elnaya, Galisnya, lrinya, Kotyali, Lalya, Litisia, Madya, Mira, Nedja, Nikya, Ostani, Pinya, Rada, Raisya, Stasolya, Tatna, Zhendoya,Zoria</span></p><p></p></div></div></div><div><table class=\"w-100 summary stripe-even\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>Ability Scores</p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>Size</p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>Speed</p></th></tr><tr><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>Strength +2; Wisdom +1</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>Medium</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>40 ft.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Age\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Age.</span> Centaurs mature and age at about the same rate as humans.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Alignment\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Alignment.</span> Centaurs are inclined toward neutrality. Those who join the Selesnya are more often neutral good, while those who join the Gruul are typically chaotic neutral.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Size\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Size.</span> Centaurs stand between 6 and 7 feet tall, with their equine bodies reaching about 4 feet at the withers. Your size is Medium.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Fey\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Fey.</span> Your creature type is fey, rather than humanoid.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Charge\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Charge.</span> If you move at least 30 feet straight toward a target and then hit it with a melee weapon attack on the same turn, you can immediately follow that attack with a bonus action, making one attack against the target with your hooves.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Hooves\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Hooves.</span> Your hooves are natural melee weapons, which you can use to make unarmed strikes. If you hit with them, you deal bludgeoning damage equal to [[/damage 1d4]] + your Strength modifier, instead of the bludgeoning damage normal for an unarmed strike.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Equine Build\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Equine Build.</span> You count as one size larger when determining your carrying capacity and the weight you can push or drag.</p><p>In addition, any climb that requires hands and feet is especially difficult for you because of your equine legs. When you make such a climb, each foot of movement costs you 4 extra feet, instead of the normal 1 extra foot.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Survivor\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Survivor.</span> You have proficiency in one of the following skills of your choice: &amp;Reference[skill=AnimalHandling]{Animal Handling}, &amp;Reference[skill=Medicine], &amp;Reference[skill=Nature], or &amp;Reference[skill=Survival].</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Languages\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Languages.</span> You can speak, read, and write Common and Sylvan. Sylvan is widely spoken in the Selesnya Conclave, for it is rich in vocabulary to describe natural phenomena and spiritual forces.</p></div></div><hr class=\"hr-1\" /><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--1\"><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p>In the sprawling city of Ravnica, where \"open road\" seems like a contradiction and \"open plain\" is sheer nonsense, centaurs nevertheless retain a love of wide spaces and the freedom to travel. As much as they can, centaurs run—in wide plazas, spacious parks, and expanses of rubble and ruin. They race the wind, hooves thundering and tails streaming behind them, until the next wall looms in their path and brings them to a stop.</p><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Nature's Cavalry\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Nature's Cavalry.</span> Centaurs have the upper bodies, down to the waist, of muscular humans, displaying all the human variety of skin tones and features. Their ears are slightly pointed, but their faces are wider and squarer than those of elves. Below the waist, they have the bodies of small horses, with a similar range of coloration—from various shades of chestnut or bay to dappled or even zebra-like striped patterns. Most centaurs style their hair and their tails in a similar way. Selesnya centaurs favor long, flowing hair. Gruul centaurs cut their hair in rough, spiky styles.</p><p>The upper bodies of centaurs are comparable to human torsos in size, and their lower equine bodies average about 4 feet tall at the withers. Though they are smaller than a human rider mounted on a horse, they fill similar roles as cavalry warriors, messengers, outriders, and scouts.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Affinity for Nature\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Affinity for Nature.</span> Centaurs have an affinity for the natural world. Among the guilds that share that affinity, centaurs favor the rubblebelts of the Gruul Clans and the wide plazas of the Selesnya Conclave over the undercity tunnels of the Golgari and the laboratories of the Simic.</p><p>Centaurs celebrate life and growth, and the birth of a foal is always cause for festivities. At the same time, they revere the traditions of the past, and among both the Gruul and the Selesnya they are voices of memory and history, preserving old ways and keeping alive the legends of ancestral heroes. They feel a close kinship with wild animals, perhaps because of their own horse-like bodies, and delight in the feeling of running alongside herds and packs of other beasts.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Clans and Community\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Clans and Community.</span> Centaurs sense the interconnectedness of the natural world. Thus, they celebrate family and community as microcosms of that greater connection. Among the Gruul, they have a strong clan identity, and Selesnya centaurs are fiercely loyal to their individual communities as well as the guild as a whole. Their love of history and tradition also means that centaurs are more likely than most other Ravnicans to join the same guild that their parents did.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Centaur Names\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Centaur Names.</span> Centaurs' given names are passed down through family lines. The name bestowed on a new foal is typically the name of the most recently deceased family member of the same gender, keeping alive the memory—and, the centaurs believe, some shard of the spirit—of the departed. Centaurs don't use family names, but they wear symbols that represent their family membership. These symbols might include graphical representations of plants or animals, printed mottoes, braids and beads worn in the hair and tail, or even specific patterns of woven fabric.</p><ul class=\"rd__list rd__list-hang-notitle\"><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Male Names:\"><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Male Names:</span> Bonmod, Boruvo, Chodi, Drozan, Kozim, Milosh, Ninos, Oleksi, Orval, Radovas, Radom, Rostis, Svetyos, Tomis, Trijiro, Volim, Vlodim, Yarog</p></li><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Female Names:\"><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Female Names:</span> Daiva, Dunja, Elnaya, Galisnya, Irinya, Kotyali, Lalya, Litisia, Madya, Mira, Nedja, Nikya, Ostani, Pinya, Rada, Raisya, Stasolya, Tatna, Zhendoya, Zoria</p></li></ul></div></div></div></div>",
